ProofPulse artifact Package in Docker:
FROM codercom/code-server:latest (the full Dockerfile is available for inspection in Dockerfile.ci)

Tested on Architecture:
* x86-64 and ARM64

Operating system:
* Linux is the primary supported platform (that was tested)
* The Docker-based review path is recommended for the most reliable evaluation (and should work on other platformns)

Software requirements:
* Docker 24 or newer for the recommended review workflow
* All other dependencies are listed under the DockerFile

Hardware requirements:
* No GPU required
* At least 8 GB RAM recommended
* At least 10 GB free disk space recommended (For the docker image)

Network requirements:
* An internet connection is required the first time the bundled ProofPulse extension and Dafny assets are loaded, because the artifact follows the standard VS Code extension packaging model for Dafny.
